  "description": "Take control of a brave carrot on a mission to protect its territory in this exciting pixel art platformer. Face challenging enemies and obstacles, using powerful punches, double jumps, and the Dash to overcome action-packed, precise levels.\n\nWith fast-paced gameplay, responsive controls, and appealing retro visuals, Carrot Smash delivers a fun and addictive platforming experience from start to finish.\n\nFeatures:\n- Precision platforming with intense action\n- Use punches, double jumps, and the Dash to defeat enemies\n- Challenging levels full of traps and obstacles\n- Charming Pixel Art visual style\n- Engaging and energetic soundtrack",
